Northwind is a mid-market e-commerce company. This preamble applies to every
module in this project.

- Target Python 3.11+.
- HTTP calls use httpx.
- Data validation uses pydantic v2 only: `model_validate`, `field_validator`,
  `ConfigDict`. Never the pydantic v1 API (no `@validator`, no inner `Config`
  class, no `.dict()` / `.parse_obj()`).
- Money is always an integer quantity of minor units of a currency, plus an
  ISO 4217 currency code string. Never a float. Never a `Decimal`.
- Internal domain types are frozen pydantic models (`ConfigDict(frozen=True)`)
  and carry no vendor-specific or carrier-specific concepts.
